            "text": "Overly broad exception catch (CWE-396): catching \\Throwable or \\Exception swallows all errors and exceptions, masking programming bugs (type errors, OOM, assertion failures) and making root-cause analysis harder. Catch the most specific exception type your code can meaningfully handle.\n"
          },
          "properties": {},
          "ruleId": "semgrep.catch-generic-exception-type"
